msgstr "Greit å vite:"

#: install/index.php:434
msgid ""
"Use your callsign as your username for QRZ.com. The XML API does not support "
"email addresses."
msgstr ""
"Bruk kallesignalet ditt som brukernavn for QRZ.com. XML-API-en støtter ikke "
"e-postadresser."

#: install/index.php:442
msgid "API Token"
msgstr "API-token"

#: install/index.php:452
msgid "Generate a Personal Access Token at"
msgstr "Generer en personlig tilgangstoken på"

#: install/index.php:454
msgid "Requires a Data or Extra subscription."
msgstr "Krever et Data- eller Ekstra-abonnement."

#: install/index.php:457 install/index.php:462
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Avanserte innstillinger"

#: install/index.php:465
msgid "These settings should only be set if you know what you're doing."
msgstr "Disse innstillingene bør bare settes hvis du vet hva du gjør."

#: install/index.php:468
msgid "Error Logs"
msgstr "Feillogger"

#: install/index.php:469
msgid ""
"Optional: Enable Error Logging by setting the log threshold bigger then 0. "
"Only enable this if you really need it."
msgstr ""
"Valgfritt: Aktiver feilregistrering ved å sette loggterskelen større enn 0. "
"Aktiver dette bare hvis du virkelig trenger det."

#: install/index.php:474
msgid "0 - No logs"
msgstr "0 - Ingen logger"

#: install/index.php:475
msgid "1 - Error messages"
msgstr "1 - Feilmeldinger"

#: install/index.php:476
msgid "2 - Debug messages"
msgstr "2 - Feilsøkingsmeldinger"

#: install/index.php:477
msgid "3 - Info messages"
msgstr "3 - Informasjonsmeldinger"

#: install/index.php:478
msgid "4 - All messages"
msgstr "4 - Alle meldinger"

#: install/index.php:500
msgid ""
"To properly install Wavelog you already should have setup a mariadb/mysql "
"database. Provide the parameters here."
msgstr ""
"For å installere Wavelog riktig, bør du allerede ha satt opp en mariadb/"
"mysql-database. Oppgi parameterne her."

#: install/index.php:504
msgid "Hostname or IP"
msgstr "Servernavn eller IP"

#: install/index.php:504
msgid ""
"Usually 'localhost'.<br>Optional with '[host]:[port]'. Default port: 3306."
"<br>In a docker compose install type 'wavelog-db'."
msgstr ""
"Vanligvis 'localhost'.<br>Valgfritt med '[host]:[port]'. Standardport: "
"3306.<br>I en docker-compose-installasjon skriv 'wavelog-db'."

#: install/index.php:510
